<title>UK: Christiania Bank sets $250 mln three-year FRN.</title>
<headline>Christiania Bank sets $250 mln three-year FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Lehman Brothers.</p>
<p> BORROWER   CHRISIANIA BANK</p>
<p> AMT    $250 MLN	BASE	 3M LIBOR  MATURITY    18.JUL.00</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN     FLAT	PAY DATE    18.JUL.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  15 BP     ISS PRICE  99.983    REOFFER     99.983</p>
<p> MOODY	=	   LISTING    LONDON    PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  =	   DENOMS (K) 10-100    SALE LIMITS US/UK/NO</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   IPMA 2</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  NORWAY    TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    5 BP	SELL CONC  10 BP     PRAECIPUUM  NONE</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF AN EMTN PROGRAMME.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
